# Revising against feedback (surgical modification)

* **Every subcomponent the feedback doesn't mention must round-trip
  unchanged.** Preserve `<public-surface>` routes verbatim unless the
  feedback names them — a route rename breaks navigation edges
  declared upstream in `screens`.
* **"Rename X to Y"** — edit `<name>` only. **"Add a screen to this
  collection"**, **"add / drop a rendered UI collection"**, **"add /
  drop a backend call"** — all three are `frontend_sysarch`'s own
  decisions, not this tier's; push back rather than absorbing them
  here. **"Add / drop a `<journeys>` entry"** — edit only that block.
  **"Re-articulate a fragment section"** — edit only that section.
* Don't reshuffle `<journeys>` or subcomponent decomposition the
  feedback isn't pointed at.
